<p>I admit, I was kind of worried about getting this reaction. I generally tried to give the object a kind of &quot;feel&quot; to give it some place in the modern day, with the references to the actual 5 Mao Party and Chinese censorship, as well as use the Addendum to give it some additional draw. I was originally intending on having all sorts of tests for it, but then I realized how much it would cost to retrieve it over and over and all the cover-up required for a simple Safe-class object, and so I used the Addendum to portray the Foundation as being a very busy organization with limited funds and urgent priorities, and the researchers having to make do with making hypotheses that may or may not be true. I completely understand this reaction, though, and as long as you enjoyed the writing itself I'm still quite pleased.</p>

